sions with owned notes\",\"facts\":[[10,{\"kw\":\"session/id\"},\"s1\"],[11,{\"kw\":\"session/id\"},\"s2\"],[100,{\"kw\":\"note/session\"},10],[100,{\"kw\":\"note/text\"},\"a\"],[101,{\"kw\":\"note/session\"},10],[101,{\"kw\":\"note/text\"},\"b\"],[102,{\"kw\":\"note/session\"},11],[102,{\"kw\":\"note/text\"},\"c\"]]},\"feed\":{\"view\":\"facts\",\"note\":\"list surface; item 200 has two tags so a join yields duplicate bindings\",\"facts\":[[200,{\"kw\":\"item/kind\"},{\"kw\":\"post\"}],[200,{\"kw\":\"item/tag\"},{\"kw\":\"a\"}],[200,{\"kw\":\"item/tag\"},{\"kw\":\"b\"}],[201,{\"kw\":\"item/kind\"},{\"kw\":\"post\"}],[201,{\"kw\":\"item/tag\"},{\"kw\":\"a\"}],[202,{\"kw\":\"item/kind\"},{\"kw\":\"post\"}],[203,{\"kw\":\"item/kind\"},{\"kw\":\"post\"}],[204,{\"kw\":\"item/kind\"},{\"kw\":\"post\"}],[205,{\"kw\":\"item/kind\"},{\"kw\":\"post\"}]]},\"nums\":{\"view\":\"facts\",\"note\":\"value 4 occurs on two entities\",\"facts\":[[1,{\"kw\":\"n/v\"},4],[2,{\"kw\":\"n/v\"},4],[3,{\"kw\":\"n/v\"},1]]},\"scale\":{\"view\":\"facts\",\"note\":\"1.0M and 1.00M: content-distinct decimals that are host = on the JVM\",\"facts\":[[1,{\"kw\":\"n/v\"},{\"decimal\":{\"exponent\":-1,\"mantissa\":\"10\"}}],[2,{\"kw\":\"n/v\"},{\"decimal\":{\"exponent\":-2,\"mantissa\":\"100\"}}]]},\"zeros\":{\"view\":\"facts\",\"note\":\"+0.0 and -0.0 doubles: content-distinct, host = on affected hosts\",\"facts\":[[1,{\"kw\":\"z/v\"},{\"float64-bits\":\"0000000000000000\"}],[2,{\"kw\":\"z/v\"},{\"float64-bits\":\"8000000000000000\"}]]},\"d5-history\":{\"view\":\"current-d5\",\"note\":\"d5 rows [e a v t m]; value 1 is retracted at t3, so the current view holds only 2\",\"facts\":[[1,{\"kw\":\"n/v\"},1,1,1],[1,{\"kw\":\"n/v\"},2,2,1],[1,{\"kw\":\"n/v\"},1,3,0]]},\"scores\":{\"view\":\"facts\",\"note\":\"two groups of scores; value 4 occurs on two entities in group b\",\"facts\":[[1,{\"kw\":\"s/g\"},\"a\"],[1,{\"kw\":\"s/v\"},1],[2,{\"kw\":\"s/g\"},\"a\"],[2,{\"kw\":\"s/v\"},2],[3,{\"kw\":\"s/g\"},\"a\"],[3,{\"kw\":\"s/v\"},3],[4,{\"kw\":\"s/g\"},\"b\"],[4,{\"kw\":\"s/v\"},4],[5,{\"kw\":\"s/g\"},\"b\"],[5,{\"kw\":\"s/v\"},10],[6,{\"kw\":\"s/g\"},\"b\"],[6,{\"kw\":\"s/v\"},4]]},\"ties\":{\"view\":\"facts\",\"note\":\"1 and 1.0 tie in comparator order and are content-distinct\",\"facts\":[[1,{\"kw\":\"k/v\"},1],[2,{\"kw\":\"k/v\"},{\"float64-bits\":\"3ff0000000000000\"}],[3,{\"kw\":\"k/v\"},1],[4,{\"kw\":\"k/v\"},{\"float64-bits\":\"4000000000000000\"}]]},\"graph\":{\"view\":\"facts\",\"note\":\"a cycle 1->2->3->1, a branch 3->4 and a separate component 5->6\",\"facts\":[[1,{\"kw\":\"e\"},2],[2,{\"kw\":\"e\"},3],[3,{\"kw\":\"e\"},1],[3,{\"kw\":\"e\"},4],[5,{\"kw\":\"e\"},6]]},\"empty\":{\"view\":\"facts\",\"note\":\"no facts\",\"facts\":[]}},\ntest/yang/clojure_test.clj:920:  (testing \"top-level definitions are unaffected, and the native path is unchanged\"\ntest/resources/dao/jing/cbor-v1.errata.md:58:are unaffected. The JVM compares identifiers by fields and is unaffected;\ntest/yang/php/antlr/programs.cljc:515:    :criterion \"a copy is unaffected by writes to the other, also through a parameter\",\ntest/yin/vm/engine_test.cljc:295:  (testing \"Exact-arity calls are unaffected\"\ntest/dao/space/dht_test.cljc:1759:        (testing \"the first node is unaffected\"\ntest/dao/jing/hash_registry_contract_test.cljc:214:;; here via the real dao.jing/segment-key, which is unaffected by H0)\ntest/dao/data_test.cljc:109:  (testing \"leaf truncation is unaffected by :depth\"\ntest/dao/jing/mem_test.cljc:266:          \"the snapshot view is unaffected by mutation of an earlier view\"))))\ntest/yin/repl/store_test.cljc:457:(deftest a-second-owner-of-the-directory-is-refused-and-the-first-is-unaffected\ntest/dao/gui/event/fixtures_corpus.cljc:11660:                       :affected-pointer-ids #{12 11},\ntest/dao/gui/event/fixtures_gen.cljc:1052:                        :affected-pointer-ids #{11 12},\ntest/dao/gui/event/policy_test.cljc:124:(deftest input-loss-cancels-affect